{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01007",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.26,
      "end_seconds": 4.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.85,
      "end_seconds": 8.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.42,
      "end_seconds": 14.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Um, so... hard stools. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.15,
      "end_seconds": 19.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.62,
      "end_seconds": 26.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "I take escitalopram, once a day for the anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.31,
      "end_seconds": 29.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.21,
      "end_seconds": 32.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.84,
      "end_seconds": 34.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Ah. Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.63,
      "end_seconds": 39.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Yesterday, it came on out of nowhere."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.5,
      "end_seconds": 49.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.12,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.64,
      "end_seconds": 59.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.67,
      "text": "Low fibre definitely sets it off. Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. I get some relief from water."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.01,
      "end_seconds": 63.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.0,
      "end_seconds": 70.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "It usually comes with mild bloating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.99,
      "end_seconds": 74.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Have you been going less often?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.75,
      "end_seconds": 77.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Yes, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.37,
      "end_seconds": 81.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.53,
      "end_seconds": 89.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "I'd say mild. The mild bloating? That's been for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.31,
      "end_seconds": 97.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Have you had any severe pain, weight loss, vomiting or blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.0,
      "end_seconds": 100.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.78,
      "end_seconds": 105.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "I follow. Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.7,
      "end_seconds": 108.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.42,
      "end_seconds": 111.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.93,
      "end_seconds": 114.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.41,
      "end_seconds": 119.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.9,
      "end_seconds": 130.43,
      "duration_seconds": 10.53,
      "text": "I had a reaction to amoxicillin when I was younger, a rash all over, and I've avoided it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.4,
      "end_seconds": 135.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.39,
      "end_seconds": 145.84,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "My partner and our baby. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.38,
      "end_seconds": 163.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Alright, any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.27,
      "end_seconds": 170.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Yes, I had an operation for a hernia, last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.0,
      "end_seconds": 175.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Okay, what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.36,
      "end_seconds": 177.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "I have anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.49,
      "end_seconds": 187.8,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "Yes. Okay, I can see anxiety in your file as well. Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.95,
      "end_seconds": 199.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.35,
      "end_seconds": 220.72,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 121 over 68, pulse is 64 beats a minute, temperature is 36.4 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.62,
      "end_seconds": 224.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.36,
      "end_seconds": 243.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.32,
      "end_seconds": 247.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.72,
      "end_seconds": 267.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with no tenderness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.71,
      "end_seconds": 273.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.86,
      "end_seconds": 319.29,
      "duration_seconds": 28.43,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: I'd lean towards simple constipation from low fibre. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Eat more fruit, vegetables and oats, and drink two litres of water. Book a review if it persists after a month. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.33,
      "end_seconds": 329.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "So, I come back if it persists after a month. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.31,
      "end_seconds": 336.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.42,
      "end_seconds": 340.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}